# Input

```svelte
{#snippet children(item)}
  {item}
{/snippet}

{#snippet children(item, foo, bar)}
  {item}
{/snippet}

{#snippet row({ id, name, description }, index, firstVeryLongParameterName, secondVeryLongParameterName)}
  {name}
{/snippet}

```


# Formatted

```svelte
{#snippet children(item)}
	{item}
{/snippet}

{#snippet children(item, foo, bar)}
	{item}
{/snippet}

{#snippet row(
	{ id, name, description },
	index,
	firstVeryLongParameterName,
	secondVeryLongParameterName,
)}
	{name}
{/snippet}

```
